sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 👤 User
    participant Surface as 💬 Teams / 🤖 Copilot
    participant BFS as ☁️ Bot Framework<br/>Service
    participant CEA as Layer 3: CopilotAgent<br/>(M365 SDK Proxy)
    participant A2A as Layer 1: Orchestrator<br/>(A2A Server)
    participant BW as 📝 BlogWriter<br/>Agent
    participant RV as ✏️ Reviewer<br/>Agent
    participant LLM as ☁️ GPT-4o<br/>(AI Foundry)

    Note over User,LLM: STEP 1 — User sends message through M365 surface
    User->>Surface: "Write a blog about AI"
    
    Note over Surface,BFS: STEP 2 — Teams/Copilot routes through Bot Framework
    Surface->>BFS: Activity message with text
    
    Note over BFS,CEA: STEP 3 — BFS authenticates and forwards to bot endpoint
    BFS->>CEA: POST /api/messages + Bearer JWT
    
    Note over CEA: JWT Validation: verify issuer, audience, signature
    
    Note over CEA,Surface: STEP 4 — Acknowledge receipt immediately
    CEA-->>BFS: Working on your blog post...
    BFS-->>Surface: Display acknowledgment
    Surface-->>User: Shows typing indicator

    Note over CEA,A2A: STEP 5 — Forward to orchestrator via A2A protocol
    CEA->>A2A: POST /a2a/orchestrator JSON-RPC 2.0 message/stream
    
    Note over A2A,BW: STEP 6 — Orchestrator runs multi-agent workflow
    A2A->>BW: Superstep 1: Generate draft
    BW->>LLM: Blog writer instructions + user topic
    LLM-->>BW: Draft blog post streamed
    
    Note over BW,RV: STEP 7 — Sequential edge: draft flows to reviewer
    BW->>RV: Draft output becomes reviewer input
    RV->>LLM: Editor instructions + draft
    LLM-->>RV: Polished blog post streamed
    
    Note over A2A,CEA: STEP 8 — Stream response back via SSE
    RV-->>A2A: Final polished post
    A2A-->>CEA: SSE data stream with JSON-RPC results

    Note over CEA: Typing indicators sent every 8s during processing

    Note over CEA,User: STEP 9 — Deliver final response to user
    CEA-->>BFS: Activity message with blog post
    BFS-->>Surface: Route response to channel
    Surface-->>User: Displays polished blog post
